  "research": {
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": false,
    "note": "Status is stored as palearctic-migrant. The research treated this as a Palearctic summer visitor, which is the same movement, and palearctic-migrant is the status this site already uses. No breeding plumage in Africa; morph and age variation dominate. Gaps: Biodiversity Explorer page for Buteo buteo was not found (404). Confusion with Forest Buzzard is unresolved in many photos. Juvenile text thin in open sources used. GBIF Kruger peak Oct–Mar. Curated images prefer labelled B. b. vulpinus / Steppe Buzzard from Kruger and nearby. monthsPresent set from Newman/SABAP seasonality cross-checked with GBIF Kruger month facets (not abundance)."
  }
